{
    "type": "page",
    "title": "风险分析交互示例",
    "titleClassName": "text-center",
    "css": {
        ".cxd-Page-title": {
            "text-align": "center !important",
            "width": "100%"
        }
    },
    "body": [
        {
            "type": "alert",
            "level": "info",
            "body": "💡 **交互说明**: 点击饼图的任意扇区，可以查看该分类下的详细清册。表格中每条记录都有操作按钮。",
            "showCloseButton": false
        },
        {
            "type": "divider"
        },
        {
            "type": "grid",
            "columns": [
                {
                    "md": 6,
                    "body": {
                        "type": "panel",
                        "title": "风险分类分布",
                        "body": {
                            "type": "chart",
                            "api": "/api/demo/chart/risk-pie",
                            "height": 400,
                            "clickAction": {
                                "actionType": "dialog",
                                "dialog": {
                                    "title": "${event.data.name}客户清册 (共${event.data.value}条)",
                                    "size": "xl",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "button",
                                            "label": "关闭",
                                            "actionType": "close"
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "body": {
                                        "type": "service",
                                        "api": {
                                            "method": "get",
                                            "url": "/api/demo/risk-list/high",
                                            "requestAdaptor": "const itemId = context.event?.data?.itemId || 'high'; return { ...api, url: '/api/demo/risk-list/' + itemId };"
                                        },
                                        "body": {
                                            "type": "table",
                                            "affixHeader": true,
                                            "columns": [
                                                {
                                                    "name": "id",
                                                    "label": "ID",
                                                    "width": 60
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "name": "customer_name",
                                                    "label": "客户姓名"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "name": "amount",
                                                    "label": "贷款金额",
                                                    "type": "tpl",
                                                    "tpl": "¥${amount | number:0,0}"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "name": "overdue_days",
                                                    "label": "逾期天数",
                                                    "type": "mapping",
                                                    "map": {
                                                        "*": "<span class='label label-${overdue_days > 60 ? \"danger\" : overdue_days > 30 ? \"warning\" : \"success\"}'>${overdue_days}天</span>"
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "name": "risk_score",
                                                    "label": "风险评分",
                                                    "type": "progress",
                                                    "map": {
                                                        "*": {
                                                            "value": "${risk_score}",
                                                            "color": "${risk_score >= 80 ? 'danger' : risk_score >= 50 ? 'warning' : 'success'}"
                                                        }
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "name": "status",
                                                    "label": "处理状态",
                                                    "type": "mapping",
                                                    "map": {
                                                        "pending": "<span class='label label-warning'>待处理</span>",
                                                        "processing": "<span class='label label-info'>处理中</span>",
                                                        "completed": "<span class='label label-success'>已完成</span>"
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "operation",
                                                    "label": "操作",
                                                    "width": 180,
                                                    "buttons": [
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "button",
                                                            "label": "详情",
                                                            "level": "link",
                                                            "icon": "fa fa-eye",
                                                            "actionType": "dialog",
                                                            "dialog": {
                                                                "title": "客户详细信息 - ${customer_name}",
                                                                "size": "lg",
                                                                "body": {
                                                                    "type": "form",
                                                                    "mode": "horizontal",
                                                                    "wrapWithPanel": false,
                                                                    "initApi": {
                                                                        "method": "get",
                                                                        "url": "/api/demo/customer/${id}"
                                                                    },
                                                                    "api": {
                                                                        "method": "post",
                                                                        "url": "/api/demo/customer/${id}"
                                                                    },
                                                                    "body": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "type": "static",
                                                                            "name": "id",
                                                                            "label": "客户ID"
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "type": "input-text",
                                                                            "name": "customer_name",
                                                                            "label": "客户姓名",
                                                                            "required": true
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "type": "input-number",
                                                                            "name": "amount",
                                                                            "label": "贷款金额",
                                                                            "prefix": "¥",
                                                                            "required": true
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "type": "input-number",
                                                                            "name": "overdue_days",
                                                                            "label": "逾期天数",
                                                                            "min": 0
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "type": "input-number",
                                                                            "name": "risk_score",
                                                                            "label": "风险评分",
                                                                            "min": 0,
                                                                            "max": 100,
                                                                            "description": "0-100分，分数越高风险越大"
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "type": "select",
                                                                            "name": "status",
                                                                            "label": "处理状态",
                                                                            "options": [
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "label": "待处理",
                                                                                    "value": "pending"
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "label": "处理中",
                                                                                    "value": "processing"
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "label": "已完成",
                                                                                    "value": "completed"
                                                                                }
                                                                            ]
                                                                        }
                                                                    ]
                                                                }
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "button",
                                                            "label": "标记完成",
                                                            "level": "success",
                                                            "size": "sm",
                                                            "icon": "fa fa-check",
                                                            "visibleOn": "${status !== 'completed'}",
                                                            "actionType": "ajax",
                                                            "confirmText": "确认将客户 ${customer_name} 标记为已处理？",
                                                            "api": {
                                                                "method": "post",
                                                                "url": "/api/demo/customer/${id}/mark-processed"
                                                            },
                                                            "reload": "window"
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                {
                    "md": 6,
                    "body": [
                        {
                            "type": "panel",
                            "title": "统计概览",
                            "body": {
                                "type": "cards",
                                "source": "$items",
                                "card": {
                                    "body": {
                                        "type": "container",
                                        "style": {
                                            "padding": "20px",
                                            "textAlign": "center"
                                        },
                                        "body": [
                                            {
                                                "type": "tpl",
                                                "tpl": "<h2 style='margin:0;color:${color}'>${value}</h2>"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "type": "tpl",
                                                "tpl": "<p style='margin:5px 0 0 0;color:#666'>${label}</p>"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                }
                            },
                            "data": {
                                "items": [
                                    {
                                        "label": "高风险客户",
                                        "value": "3",
                                        "color": "#f5222d"
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "label": "中风险客户",
                                        "value": "3",
                                        "color": "#fa8c16"
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "label": "低风险客户",
                                        "value": "3",
                                        "color": "#52c41a"
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "panel",
                            "title": "使用说明",
                            "body": {
                                "type": "markdown",
                                "value": "## 功能演示\n\n1. **点击饼图扇区** - 弹出该风险等级的客户清册\n2. **查看详情按钮** - 打开客户详细信息表单\n3. **编辑保存** - 在表单中修改信息并保存\n4. **标记完成** - 快速标记客户为已处理状态\n\n### 交互亮点\n- 📊 ECharts交互式图表\n- 📋 动态数据加载\n- 🔘 多层级弹窗嵌套\n- 📝 表单CRUD操作\n- 🎨 条件样式渲染"
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}